766
00:56:04.583 --> 00:56:06.917
I wish I could tell you. I just...

767
00:56:10.000 --> 00:56:11.500
We knew each other. didn't we?

768
00:56:15.250 --> 00:56:16.167
What?

769
00:56:17.167 --> 00:56:18.500
It's the only explanation.

770
00:56:19.833 --> 00:56:21.083
It's been driving me crazy for years...

771
00:56:21.333 --> 00:56:23.667
all the times that Spider-Man
saved either me or Ned.

772
00:56:24.417 --> 00:56:25.333
It was the Washington Monument...

773
00:56:25.583 --> 00:56:28.083
and then it was London and Prague
and the Night Monkey.

774
00:56:29.000 --> 00:56:31.417
I mean. twice is a coincidence.
but over and over again...

775
00:56:33.833 --> 00:56:35.500
We knew each other. Tell me I'm wrong.

776
00:56:38.750 --> 00:56:41.500
What were we?
Were we classmates or friends or something?

777
00:56:42.167 --> 00:56:44.333
Look. I don't know what you're talking about.

778
00:56:44.583 --> 00:56:45.667
Were we something more?

779
00:56:47.917 --> 00:56:50.167
I just. I can't. I can't remember.

780
00:56:50.333 --> 00:56:52.083
And I feel like someone scrambled my brain.

781
00:56:52.417 --> 00:56:54.250
And you're the only one who would know why.

782
00:56:55.417 --> 00:56:56.583
This is crazy. I can't...

783
00:56:56.750 --> 00:56:58.667
I know that you can't
tell me the truth.

784
00:57:01.667 --> 00:57:02.833
But I need to know.

785
00:57:08.083 --> 00:57:10.000
Maybe there's a part of me
that still remembers.

786
00:57:53.667 --> 00:57:54.667
MJ.

787
00:57:54.833 --> 00:57:55.917
Hey. Peter.

788
00:58:02.417 --> 00:58:03.833
I've missed you so much.

789
00:58:08.833 --> 00:58:10.500
I can't believe you figured it out.

790
00:58:11.000 --> 00:58:12.000
I did.

791
00:58:17.750 --> 00:58:20.167
Go ahead. Peter. Touch her.

792
00:58:21.667 --> 00:58:22.917
Hold her.

793
00:58:24.333 --> 00:58:25.750
You've been wanting to for so long.

794
00:58:34.667 --> 00:58:36.250
True love's kiss breaks the spell...

795
00:58:37.167 --> 00:58:39.000
and reunites the star-crossed lovers.

796
00:58:41.250 --> 00:58:42.417
MJ would vomit.

797
00:58:45.167 --> 00:58:46.750
You really are a simple spider. aren't you?

798
00:58:50.417 --> 00:58:51.250
I see why you like her.

799
00:58:52.000 --> 00:58:53.000
She's...

800
00:58:54.250 --> 00:58:55.667
she's smart...

801
00:58:56.167 --> 00:58:57.167
funny...

802
00:58:58.083 --> 00:58:59.333
and a little dark and twisted.

803
00:59:03.417 --> 00:59:04.500
I mean. it is sad.

804
00:59:05.667 --> 00:59:08.750
There is. like. no thoughts of you in here...

805
00:59:10.167 --> 00:59:11.333
whatsoever.

806
00:59:12.917 --> 00:59:14.167
But you knew that. didn't you?

807
00:59:15.583 --> 00:59:16.917
You're a monster.

808
00:59:17.833 --> 00:59:19.500
If you loved someone 
the way that I love her...

809
00:59:19.750 --> 00:59:22.417
then you'd know that
what you're doing right now is unforgivable.

810
00:59:22.583 --> 00:59:23.667
Is that so?

811
00:59:30.667 --> 00:59:33.667
You know. some people would kill
to hold the person they love one last time

812
00:59:35.667 --> 00:59:37.000
Stop it now.

813
00:59:46.833 --> 00:59:48.167
You're running out of time. Peter.

814
00:59:49.333 --> 00:59:52.833
Soon enough. it won't just be your friends
who don't remember Peter Parker.

815
00:59:54.333 --> 00:59:56.000
Maybe you should write a letter to yourself.

816
01:00:00.667 --> 01:00:01.667
Get out of her.

817
01:00:03.250 --> 01:00:04.583
Who's the monster now. Peter?

818
01:00:28.000 --> 01:00:28.917
MJ.

819
01:00:29.583 --> 01:00:31.833
MJ. No. no. no. Oh. God.

820
01:00:32.000 --> 01:00:33.500
Oh. God. please. no. come on.

821
01:00:33.750 --> 01:00:35.250
Come on. come on. come on.

822
01:00:35.500 --> 01:00:37.917
Oh. thank God. Oh. thank God.

823
01:00:38.083 --> 01:00:40.917
Oh. you're okay. Oh. you're okay.

824
01:00:41.083 --> 01:00:42.333
Oh. I'm so sorry.

825
01:00:44.833 --> 01:00:46.917
Stop. Wait. wait. stop. stop.
please. I'll quit.

826
01:00:47.167 --> 01:00:49.250
You win. you win. you win.
Just don't hurt her.

827
01:00:52.333 --> 01:00:53.750
You're a mess. Spider-Man.

828
01:00:56.500 --> 01:00:57.917
Anytime I want...

829
01:00:58.083 --> 01:00:59.417
I can be anyone I want.

830
01:01:00.667 --> 01:01:02.417
So you can't protect MJ...

831
01:01:03.833 --> 01:01:05.417
even from herself.

832
01:01:12.833 --> 01:01:14.250
It really is a nice letter.

833
01:01:15.250 --> 01:01:16.250
Little heavy-handed.

834
01:01:16.500 --> 01:01:17.500
But not bad.

835
01:01:36.500 --> 01:01:38.917
You're okay.
I'm gonna take you someplace safe.

836
01:01:39.167 --> 01:01:40.083
What?

837
01:01:41.500 --> 01:01:42.583
Take me to 3165...

838
01:01:42.833 --> 01:01:43.917
Lafayette Street.

839
01:01:44.167 --> 01:01:46.500
Navigating to Empire State University.

840
01:01:51.500 --> 01:01:52.750
Wait. wait. wait! Okay.

841
01:01:55.000 --> 01:01:56.083
-I got you. I got you.
-Are you sure?

842
01:01:56.250 --> 01:01:57.083
-Yep.
-Okay.

843
01:01:57.250 --> 01:01:58.333
'Cause I feel like
I'm slipping a little bit.

844
01:01:58.500 --> 01:01:59.417
-You're not slipping.
-Okay.

845
01:02:01.417 --> 01:02:02.500
You're okay. you're okay. you're okay.

846
01:02:02.750 --> 01:02:04.333
Yeah. yeah. yeah. I'm fine. I'm fine.

847
01:02:08.000 --> 01:02:08.667
Okay.

848
01:02:08.917 --> 01:02:09.917
Can we just slow down...

849
01:02:10.167 --> 01:02:11.417
-for like two seconds. please?
-Well. we're almost there.

850
01:02:11.667 --> 01:02:13.750
Yeah. yeah. but you just told me
I was mind controlled.

851
01:02:13.917 --> 01:02:14.833
Well. not technically.

852
01:02:15.000 --> 01:02:16.083
I mean. you're lucky
I believe in that stuff. okay?

853
01:02:16.250 --> 01:02:18.333
Because governments have been doing it
for years. especially the French.

854
01:02:19.083 --> 01:02:20.167
-Are you okay?
-Yeah...

855
01:02:20.417 --> 01:02:22.750
Look. Sorry. I'm just trying
to take you someplace safe. okay?

856
01:02:27.417 --> 01:02:28.667
I don't feel safe.

857
01:02:30.750 --> 01:02:31.583
Oh. shit.

858
01:02:36.750 --> 01:02:37.917
-Sorry.
-Oh. watch out!

859
01:02:47.500 --> 01:02:48.750
You're losing it. kid.

860
01:02:49.167 --> 01:02:51.583
Thought you'd be able to see that coming
a mile away.

861
01:02:51.750 --> 01:02:52.750
What is wrong with you?

862
01:02:52.917 --> 01:02:54.167
-You could've killed us.
-Excuse me.

863
01:02:54.583 --> 01:02:57.083
You show up to my house unannounced.
what do you think's gonna happen?

864
01:02:57.250 --> 01:02:58.083
Wait. this is your house?

865
01:02:58.333 --> 01:02:59.333
-No. no. Don't. don't. don't.
-Who the hell is that?

866
01:02:59.833 --> 01:03:00.750
Who the hell are you?

867
01:03:01.500 --> 01:03:02.417
She's...

868
01:03:03.500 --> 01:03:04.417
You know.

869
01:03:04.667 --> 01:03:06.583
No. I don't know.
That's why I just asked you.

870
01:03:06.833 --> 01:03:09.417
She's in danger. Frank.
Look. I need your help. okay?

871
01:03:09.583 --> 01:03:11.583
-Yeah. looks like it.
-Well. come on. You owe me.

872
01:03:12.250 --> 01:03:14.583
-For... Aren't you sick of this story?
-Staten Island!

873
01:03:14.833 --> 01:03:16.167
Nah. Staten Island.

874
01:03:16.333 --> 01:03:18.667
What more do you want me to do?
I literally saved your life.

875
01:03:18.917 --> 01:03:19.750
You're out of your mind. kid!

876
01:03:19.917 --> 01:03:20.833
What. I gotta save it twice...

877
01:03:21.000 --> 01:03:22.083
-to get a favor out of you?
-That guy couldn't hit me...

878
01:03:22.333 --> 01:03:24.417
-with a handful of rice.
-I mean. what does that sound like to you?

879
01:03:24.583 --> 01:03:25.667
-I had him exactly where I want him.
-A drug dealer was gonna shoot a guy...

880
01:03:25.833 --> 01:03:27.000
-I'm seein' him right there.
-...then I webbed the gun...

881
01:03:27.167 --> 01:03:28.333
-...out of the drug dealer's hand...
-I know exactly what I'm...

882
01:03:28.500 --> 01:03:29.667
-...completely up for.
-...and then kicked that drug dealer...

883
01:03:29.833 --> 01:03:30.667
-Okay. fine. go ahead.
-...back into a storage container.

884
01:03:30.917 --> 01:03:32.250
-What would you call that?
-What does that sound like to you?

885
01:03:33.583 --> 01:03:34.667
I don't care. I just wanna go home.

886
01:03:35.667 --> 01:03:37.750
That's an excellent idea. Kick rocks.

887
01:03:37.917 --> 01:03:39.583
-Go home.
-No. wait. wait. Frank. Frank. Frank. wait.

888
01:03:39.750 --> 01:03:40.583
Please.

889
01:03:41.750 --> 01:03:45.417
I have got to keep her safe. okay?
And I don't have anywhere else to go.

890
01:03:49.333 --> 01:03:50.333
You like chili?

891
01:03:51.667 --> 01:03:52.583
I made chili.

892
01:03:54.417 --> 01:03:55.333
All right. Just...

893
01:03:56.250 --> 01:03:57.333
watch out for the claymores.

894
01:03:57.583 --> 01:04:00.000
Don't wanna pick up pieces of you 
for the next two weeks.

895
01:04:01.500 --> 01:04:03.500
Hey. I definitely would not eat that chili.

896
01:04:05.417 --> 01:04:07.083
So. you telling me that maniac...

897
01:04:07.333 --> 01:04:10.500
behind all that tank nonsense
is nothing but a goddamn teenager?

898
01:04:10.750 --> 01:04:14.333
And it's not just the tank. it's every attack
on Damage Control this past month.

899
01:04:14.583 --> 01:04:16.333
And how does a kid learn how to drive a tank?

900
01:04:16.583 --> 01:04:17.583
I don't know. Frank.

901
01:04:17.833 --> 01:04:20.750
-Beat you all over the street like that.
-She did not beat me.

902
01:04:21.750 --> 01:04:22.833
This your family?

903
01:04:25.833 --> 01:04:27.583
Would you get the hell away from that?

904
01:04:28.333 --> 01:04:30.417
Look. I got one rule in this house.

905
01:04:30.583 --> 01:04:33.250
You don't touch anything.
You don't move anything.

906
01:04:33.417 --> 01:04:36.417
You sure as shit don't ask me
any goddamn questions about anything.

907
01:05:15.917 --> 01:05:16.667
But she's classified as a telepath. 
And now we have a name.

908
01:05:20.833 --> 01:05:21.750
"Jean Grey."

909
01:05:23.750 --> 01:05:27.417
Yeah. These are the Damage Control sites
that she hasn't hit yet...

910
01:05:27.583 --> 01:05:28.833
so if she surfaces...

911
01:05:29.083 --> 01:05:31.000
then my facial tracking program
will pick her up.

912
01:05:33.250 --> 01:05:34.583
Oh. yeah? What then?

913
01:05:37.000 --> 01:05:39.667
Well. don't worry about "what then."
Just look after her.

914
01:05:39.833 --> 01:05:41.250
Don't worry about it. huh?

915
01:05:41.417 --> 01:05:43.250
I'm just supposed to sit here and
babysit your girlfriend?

916
01:05:43.417 --> 01:05:45.083
-I don't need to be babysat. so yeah.
-She's not my girlfriend.

917
01:05:45.333 --> 01:05:47.333
All right. all right.
Look. what's the plan. huh?

918
01:05:47.583 --> 01:05:51.000
Just gonna hope that
your facial tracking program works?

919
01:05:51.167 --> 01:05:53.333
And you get yourself killed.
I gotta watch her the rest of my life?

920
01:05:53.500 --> 01:05:55.750
I'm not gonna get killed. Frank.
I can catch her. okay?

921
01:05:55.917 --> 01:05:56.750
I just...

922
01:05:56.917 --> 01:05:59.417
I just have to fix my inhibitor
and then I'll be good to go.

923
01:06:00.000 --> 01:06:01.417
Well. what do you need to do that?

924
01:06:02.750 --> 01:06:06.333
Frank. You do not have
what I need to do that. okay?

925
01:06:07.833 --> 01:06:09.167
You know you've got some mouth on you.

926
01:06:09.333 --> 01:06:11.167
What do you think.
you have an anti-static mat...

927
01:06:11.333 --> 01:06:13.000
a tonal probe. and micro tools?

928
01:06:13.667 --> 01:06:15.083
I got all that shit.

929
01:06:15.667 --> 01:06:16.667
What for?

930
01:06:16.833 --> 01:06:18.250
-Bombs.
-Bingo.

931
01:06:20.667 --> 01:06:21.667
Unbelievable.

932
01:06:33.583 --> 01:06:35.750
Hey. do you think it's safe
to maybe call someone...

933
01:06:35.917 --> 01:06:37.583
and let them know I'm okay?

934
01:06:42.000 --> 01:06:43.000
Like your boyfriend?

935
01:06:44.250 --> 01:06:46.500
No. Like my roommate.

936
01:06:50.583 --> 01:06:53.000
I don't think that's such a good idea.
you know. because...

937
01:06:54.083 --> 01:06:57.417
she already knows who he is.
and she can inhabit anyone she wants. so...

938
01:06:57.583 --> 01:06:58.583
Right. Yeah.

939
01:06:58.750 --> 01:07:00.083
Yeah. yeah. yeah. You're right.

940
01:07:00.250 --> 01:07:02.750
-Sorry.
-No. it's fine. I totally get it.

941
01:07:04.917 --> 01:07:06.083
If I called my boyfriend...

942
01:07:07.167 --> 01:07:09.250
he'd just ask me a bunch of questions
that I couldn't answer...

943
01:07:09.417 --> 01:07:12.750
and then he'd tell me
I was being withholding again.

944
01:07:12.917 --> 01:07:14.667
-Withholding?
-Yep.

945
01:07:14.917 --> 01:07:16.750
Sounds like your boyfriend's kind of a jerk.

946
01:07:19.583 --> 01:07:20.750
But why'd he think you're withholding?

947
01:07:21.667 --> 01:07:25.583
I don't know. You tell me.
masked vigilante behind the curtain.

948
01:07:27.833 --> 01:07:29.500
Okay. I see your point.

949
01:07:31.500 --> 01:07:32.583
So what about you?

950
01:07:33.167 --> 01:07:34.167
What about me?

951
01:07:35.167 --> 01:07:38.417
Well. do you have a Mrs. Spider-Man?

952
01:07:40.500 --> 01:07:42.250
Do I have a Mrs. Spider-Man?

953
01:07:46.333 --> 01:07:47.917
No. No.

954
01:07:49.000 --> 01:07:50.000
Why not?

955
01:07:50.167 --> 01:07:51.833
Why not? Because I'm...

956
01:07:53.583 --> 01:07:55.583
I'm too withholding. obviously.

957
01:07:56.500 --> 01:07:57.583
Welcome to the club.

958
01:08:04.583 --> 01:08:05.667
There was someone.

959
01:08:07.000 --> 01:08:08.333
-Really?
-Yeah. yeah. yeah.

960
01:08:11.417 --> 01:08:12.500
What happened?

961
01:08:15.917 --> 01:08:17.333
I had to let her go.

962
01:08:18.667 --> 01:08:19.750
To keep her safe.

963
01:08:24.083 --> 01:08:26.083
I'm sorry.
That must have been really hard for you.

964
01:08:27.500 --> 01:08:29.417
Yeah. it was. Yeah. It is.

965
01:08:30.833 --> 01:08:31.667
It is really hard.

966
01:08:36.000 --> 01:08:37.000
Are you okay?

967
01:08:37.167 --> 01:08:38.167
Yeah. Yeah. yeah. I'm okay. I...

968
01:08:38.333 --> 01:08:39.667
You know what. I'm just gonna come over.

969
01:08:39.833 --> 01:08:41.417
Hold on. hold on. hold on.

970
01:08:43.667 --> 01:08:44.500
What's going on?

971
01:08:44.667 --> 01:08:46.583
It just keeps overheating on me.

972
01:08:47.417 --> 01:08:49.083
It's been stumping me for days.

973
01:08:49.833 --> 01:08:50.833
Before I switched to aerospace...

974
01:08:51.000 --> 01:08:54.833
I was gonna major in biochemical engineering.
so. do you mind if I...

975
01:08:55.083 --> 01:08:56.250
Oh. yeah. for sure.

976
01:08:56.500 --> 01:08:57.917
Here. There you go.

977
01:09:01.750 --> 01:09:02.667
Wow.

978
01:09:05.750 --> 01:09:07.667
So. does the device itself...

979
01:09:07.833 --> 01:09:11.583
I mean. does it generate
any kind of radiation or a magnetic field?

980
01:09:11.750 --> 01:09:13.000
'Cause that would definitely interfere.

981
01:09:13.167 --> 01:09:17.000
Yeah. it has a micro magnetic field.
but I accounted for that in the design.

982
01:09:17.167 --> 01:09:19.000
Okay. well. what about your suit?

983
01:09:19.167 --> 01:09:22.500
It actually dissipates into the fabric.
which is pretty cool.

984
01:09:23.417 --> 01:09:24.500
Okay.

985
01:09:27.500 --> 01:09:28.583
What about those?

986
01:09:29.750 --> 01:09:30.750
What about what?

987
01:09:33.333 --> 01:09:35.917
Your goggles. or whatever you call 'em.

988
01:09:36.583 --> 01:09:39.750
They would create a field.
It would be tiny. but...

989
01:09:41.250 --> 01:09:43.667
But it's on your head.
which is very close to the inhibitor.

990
01:09:43.833 --> 01:09:45.833
Which is probably why it's overheating.

991
01:09:46.083 --> 01:09:47.917
MJ. that is genius.

992
01:09:49.667 --> 01:09:50.917
Okay. this has to work.

993
01:09:55.000 --> 01:09:56.417
Inhibitor engaged.

994
01:09:57.917 --> 01:10:00.833
Suppressing selected arachnid hormones.

995
01:10:01.833 --> 01:10:03.750
Okay. That feels better.

996
01:10:03.917 --> 01:10:05.583
That feels totally better.

997
01:10:05.750 --> 01:10:07.417
My head feels so clear.

998
01:10:08.583 --> 01:10:09.667
Web. web.

999
01:10:09.917 --> 01:10:11.833
And I'm not shooting organic webs.

1000
01:10:12.083 --> 01:10:14.333
Oh. my God. MJ. that. like. totally worked.

1001
01:10:15.500 --> 01:10:17.917
You know. this is some really intense stuff
you're working on here.

1002
01:10:20.667 --> 01:10:22.417
Well. yeah. it's really important

1003
01:10:24.833 --> 01:10:28.500
Yeah. but this is like. I mean.
this is like altering your DNA.

1004
01:10:29.750 --> 01:10:33.167
I mean. this is the kind of stuff you put on.
like. I don't know. like a monster.

1005
01:10:35.417 --> 01:10:38.500
Well. if you've seen what's been happening
to me over the last couple days...

1006
01:10:38.667 --> 01:10:39.917
then you might understand.

1007
01:10:40.583 --> 01:10:41.917
Yeah. well. I've been with you
for the last few hours...

1008
01:10:42.083 --> 01:10:43.167
and that's not what I've seen.

1009
01:10:44.083 --> 01:10:45.083
And what have you seen?

1010
01:10:46.417 --> 01:10:47.583
From my side of the curtain?

1011
01:10:49.667 --> 01:10:53.083
A really good guy who might just be changing.

1012
01:10:58.250 --> 01:11:02.000
Well. I don't mean to overstep.
I'll let you get back to it.

1013
01:11:23.250 --> 01:11:24.583
Can't sleep either. huh?

1014
01:11:25.333 --> 01:11:26.333
You want coffee?

1015
01:11:29.500 --> 01:11:30.667
You get your shit fixed?

1016
01:11:31.667 --> 01:11:34.250
Yeah. I've been wearing it all night.

1017
01:11:34.417 --> 01:11:35.500
So far. so good.

1018
01:11:36.417 --> 01:11:38.083
I made this other one universal.

1019
01:11:38.250 --> 01:11:42.750
So if I could get it on Jean.
it should completely shut down her powers.

1020
01:11:43.667 --> 01:11:45.000
You know what else would work?

1021
01:11:45.333 --> 01:11:46.667
You just shoot her.

1022
01:11:46.917 --> 01:11:47.833
Nice.

1023
01:11:50.667 --> 01:11:51.833
Jesus Christ.

1024
01:11:53.250 --> 01:11:55.417
That has gotta be the goofiest shit
I ever seen in my life.

1025
01:11:55.583 --> 01:11:58.667
What. you can't even take the mask off
to drink a cup of coffee?

1026
01:11:59.917 --> 01:12:02.917
Don't take it personally. Frank.
It stays on for everybody.

1027
01:12:03.917 --> 01:12:05.000
Even her?

1028
01:12:07.417 --> 01:12:08.500
Who is she. kid?

1029
01:12:08.667 --> 01:12:09.667
I don't know.

1030
01:12:09.833 --> 01:12:11.667
That's horseshit. Who is she?

1031
01:12:11.833 --> 01:12:14.167
-I'm telling you. I don't know who she is.
-What are you doin'? You care about her.

1032
01:12:14.333 --> 01:12:15.417
-You're pretending not to. Why?
-I don't care about her.

1033
01:12:15.583 --> 01:12:17.333
Look. I don't know who she is. Frank. Okay?

1034
01:12:17.500 --> 01:12:20.167
I don't have anybody. I'm like you.
I just keep to myself.

1035
01:12:20.333 --> 01:12:21.417
You're like me?

1036
01:12:22.750 --> 01:12:24.083
What do you know about me. kid?

1037
01:12:25.083 --> 01:12:26.250
You think this is a choice?

1038
01:12:26.417 --> 01:12:29.000
Living like this. it's a lifestyle?
Is that what you think?

1039
01:12:29.667 --> 01:12:31.167
Kid. this is a sentence.

1040
01:12:32.333 --> 01:12:33.333
You know somethin'...

1041
01:12:34.167 --> 01:12:35.583
If I had one second...

1042
01:12:36.500 --> 01:12:39.667
people I love were still breathing.
you think I'd be hiding behind a mask?

1043
01:12:40.333 --> 01:12:42.417
You think I'd pretend
to be something that I'm not...

1044
01:12:42.583 --> 01:12:44.167
acting like a goddamn coward?

1045
01:12:50.083 --> 01:12:51.250
I got a facial match.

1046
01:12:55.417 --> 01:12:57.500
She's at the Damage Control HQ in Manhattan.

1047
01:12:57.750 --> 01:12:59.000
I gotta go. Okay.

1048
01:13:03.417 --> 01:13:05.333
She's gonna be okay.

1049
01:13:05.500 --> 01:13:06.667
I'll see to it.

1050
01:13:09.667 --> 01:13:10.833
Thanks. Frank.

1051
01:13:17.583 --> 01:13:20.167
Hey.

1052
01:13:21.833 --> 01:13:23.417
You just gonna let him go by himself?

1053
01:13:24.917 --> 01:13:26.250
You know. I think he might need you.

1054
01:13:29.167 --> 01:13:30.833
Kinda like you needed him on Staten Island.

1055
01:13:34.833 --> 01:13:35.833
Yeah.

1056
01:14:13.167 --> 01:14:15.167
You can't hide from me forever. Bill.

1057
01:14:16.083 --> 01:14:19.083
You've got a strong door.
but it's the wall you have to worry about.

1058
01:14:20.083 --> 01:14:21.667
Who are you and what do you want?

1059
01:14:26.917 --> 01:14:28.083
I'm Jean Grey...

1060
01:14:29.167 --> 01:14:30.833
and you know what I want.

1061
01:15:30.250 --> 01:15:31.500
Jean?

1062
01:15:32.000 --> 01:15:34.750
You looked me up? I'm blushing.

1063
01:15:35.917 --> 01:15:38.333
I told you what would happen to your girl
if you got in my way.

1064
01:15:39.250 --> 01:15:41.000
You're not getting near her again.

1065
01:15:41.833 --> 01:15:43.583
And you're definitely
not getting inside that vault.

1066
01:15:44.083 --> 01:15:45.083
Maybe not.

1067
01:15:52.583 --> 01:15:53.833
But this guy might.

1068
01:15:56.667 --> 01:15:59.250
Jean. you don't know
what you're dealing with.

1069
01:15:59.417 --> 01:16:02.083
You know you and Bar
have a lot in common

1070
01:16:02.333 --> 01:16:06.833
Both fighting a losing battle
against the monster that lives inside you.

1071
01:16:07.000 --> 01:16:08.750
Jean. this is the Hulk. you can't just...

1072
01:16:17.333 --> 01:16:18.417
What the hell?

1073
01:16:20.583 --> 01:16:21.750
I see.

1074
01:16:23.583 --> 01:16:26.917
Trying to muzzle me like you muzzle yourself?

1075
01:16:27.083 --> 01:16:28.500
I can't let you in there.

1076
01:16:28.667 --> 01:16:30.833
Whatever V-Max is. you're not getting it.

1077
01:16:31.250 --> 01:16:32.667
Like hell I'm not.

1078
01:16:33.250 --> 01:16:34.167
Oh. crap.

1079
01:16:46.417 --> 01:16:48.417
Jean. don't do this.

1080
01:16:48.917 --> 01:16:49.917
Save your breath.

1081
01:17:15.333 --> 01:17:17.083
Frank. what are you doing here?

1082
01:17:17.333 --> 01:17:18.917
What you think I'm doing?
I'm saving you.

1083
01:17:19.167 --> 01:17:20.917
This is way above your pay grade. dude.

1084
01:17:21.083 --> 01:17:22.417
-We're fighting the Hulk.
-Oh. shit!

1085
01:17:44.917 --> 01:17:45.917
Really?

1086
01:17:58.167 --> 01:17:59.333
Get out!

1087
01:18:05.750 --> 01:18:08.167
-Stop shooting him!
-Are you out of your goddamn mind?

1088
01:18:08.333 --> 01:18:10.583
He's... Banner's not the problem! She is.

1089
01:18:24.250 --> 01:18:25.833
I thought I told you to stay home
and watch MJ.

1090
01:18:26.000 --> 01:18:27.000
Yeah. you did.

1091
01:18:27.167 --> 01:18:29.000
And then she tells me I gotta come watch you.

1092
01:18:30.417 --> 01:18:31.833
Wait. did she actually say that to you?

1093
01:18:32.917 --> 01:18:34.083
Are you blushing. daffodil?

1094
01:18:35.083 --> 01:18:36.250
I'm not blushing.

1095
01:18:38.167 --> 01:18:40.750
Goddamn it. 
I knew I should have brought a bigger gun.

1096
01:18:40.917 --> 01:18:42.083
That's a good idea. "Bring a bigger gun."

1097
01:18:42.250 --> 01:18:43.083
What are you gonna do. tickle him to death?

1098
01:18:43.500 --> 01:18:44.750
No. Look. change of plan.

1099
01:18:44.917 --> 01:18:47.500
First we get this on the Hulk.
then we go after Jean.

1100
01:18:47.667 --> 01:18:48.750
I got one better.

1101
01:18:48.917 --> 01:18:50.750
That's the highest casualty-producing threat.

1102
01:18:50.917 --> 01:18:54.167
You contain it. I go find the source.
I take it down. You got it?

1103
01:18:54.750 --> 01:18:56.667
Are you just trying
to get out of fighting the Hulk?

1104
01:18:58.250 --> 01:18:59.667
-I guess so.
-Okay. whatever. dude.

1105
01:18:59.833 --> 01:19:00.750
I got this.

1106
01:19:01.417 --> 01:19:02.833
-Wait. no. Frank. Frank. Frank.
-What?

1107
01:19:03.250 --> 01:19:04.333
Do not kill her!

1108
01:19:04.500 --> 01:19:06.583
Don't start with that soft serve bullshit.

1109
01:19:06.833 --> 01:19:08.500
You know something?
I'm gonna do this. I'm gonna do it my way.

1110
01:19:08.750 --> 01:19:11.000
Just... just go. just go.

1111
01:19:11.167 --> 01:19:12.667
And don't get within 33 feet!

1112
01:19:13.500 --> 01:19:14.667
So frustrating.

1113
01:19:29.833 --> 01:19:30.667
Hey.

1114
01:19:36.583 --> 01:19:38.667
This guy's got issues.

1115
01:19:40.083 --> 01:19:42.917
No. Oh. no.

1116
01:19:46.583 --> 01:19:49.083
Dr. Banner? Is that you?

1117
01:19:50.000 --> 01:19:52.167
Spider-Man. What happened?

1118
01:19:52.333 --> 01:19:53.333
Where am I?

1119
01:19:53.667 --> 01:19:55.250
-Hey. hey. hey.
-Did I do all this?

1120
01:19:55.417 --> 01:19:56.583
-You... 
-Did I hurt anyone?

1121
01:19:56.917 --> 01:19:59.333
It's not your fault. She was in your mind.
You weren't in control.

1122
01:19:59.500 --> 01:20:01.333
-I lost my inhibitor.
-Look here. here.

1123
01:20:01.583 --> 01:20:03.667
It's the only thing
keeping the monster inside.

1124
01:20:03.833 --> 01:20:05.583
It's okay. I got another one here.
I just need you to put this on.

1125
01:20:05.833 --> 01:20:07.417
-What is it?
-It's universal.

1126
01:20:07.583 --> 01:20:08.833
It should work on you.

1127
01:20:18.333 --> 01:20:20.667
Please. sir. there's people in the building.
Just put it on.

1128
01:20:24.417 --> 01:20:25.417
You okay?

1129
01:20:25.583 --> 01:20:28.750
My head. I think she broke something!

1130
01:20:28.917 --> 01:20:30.167
Is she still in there?

1131
01:20:31.583 --> 01:20:32.750
It's the other guy.

1132
01:20:32.917 --> 01:20:35.750
Bruce? Look. I can get you out of here. okay?

1133
01:20:36.000 --> 01:20:37.333
I just need you
to put that inhibitor on.

1134
01:20:37.500 --> 01:20:38.667
Get away from me!

1135
01:20:40.500 --> 01:20:40.833
He's coming.

1136
01:20:42.583 --> 01:20:43.833
I can't control.

1137
01:20:44.667 --> 01:20:46.250
Yes. you can. Bruce! Yes. you can!

1138
01:20:46.500 --> 01:20:49.750
Get out of the building!

1139
01:20:50.000 --> 01:20:51.417
Get everyone out of the...

1140
01:20:55.333 --> 01:20:57.000
No! No!

1141
01:20:57.250 --> 01:20:58.917
Banner. please. Look at me.

1142
01:21:01.583 --> 01:21:04.333
No Banner. No girl.

1143
01:21:05.750 --> 01:21:07.500
Only Hulk.

1144
01:21:17.333 --> 01:21:19.000
I didn't know you could get that big.

1145
01:21:25.083 --> 01:21:26.333
Good luck with that. Peter.

1146
01:21:35.583 --> 01:21:36.500
There you are.

1147
01:21:38.250 --> 01:21:39.167
Just hold still. Just hold still...

1148
01:21:53.000 --> 01:21:54.000
Oh. God.

1149
01:22:08.750 --> 01:22:09.750
No lethal rounds.

1150
01:22:22.750 --> 01:22:24.500
Tracking time to detonation.

1151
01:22:53.417 --> 01:22:55.167
Ninety seconds to detonation.

1152
01:22:55.417 --> 01:22:56.333
I know! I know!

1153
01:23:02.000 --> 01:23:03.333
Come on.

1154
01:23:03.500 --> 01:23:04.833
Why is your skin so thick?

1155
01:23:05.000 --> 01:23:06.250
Inhibitor cannot attach.

1156
01:23:06.417 --> 01:23:07.417
Come on!

1157
01:23:46.333 --> 01:23:47.250
Dr. Banner...

1158
01:23:48.667 --> 01:23:49.750
please.

1159
01:23:51.417 --> 01:23:52.250
Bruce.

1160
01:23:53.583 --> 01:23:54.333
It's Peter.

1161
01:23:56.250 --> 01:23:57.917
I'm your friend.

1162
01:24:27.250 --> 01:24:28.000
Bruce.

1163
01:24:47.333 --> 01:24:50.083
Throw down your guns.
or you'll get the next one in the head.

1164
01:25:01.417 --> 01:25:02.833
Where is she?

1165
01:25:16.333 --> 01:25:17.250
What did you...

1166
01:25:17.500 --> 01:25:18.583
It's over. Jean.

1167
01:25:33.917 --> 01:25:34.833
Sara.

1168
01:25:46.250 --> 01:25:47.333
Is that my gun?

1169
01:25:56.333 --> 01:25:59.000
Is anyone hurt? It's just me?

1170
01:26:00.000 --> 01:26:01.250
Is anyone hurt?

1171
01:26:02.833 --> 01:26:03.833
Spider-Man...

1172
01:26:06.583 --> 01:26:07.667
You saved my life.

1173
01:26:08.583 --> 01:26:10.083
And you saved God knows how many lives...

1174
01:26:10.250 --> 01:26:12.750
by making sure she didn't find
what she was looking for in there.

1175
01:26:13.000 --> 01:26:14.333
Still inside. We got her coming through.

1176
01:26:15.500 --> 01:26:17.333
Before she passed out.
she tried to say something.

1177
01:26:18.500 --> 01:26:21.083
A name. Sara.
Does that mean something to you?

1178
01:26:22.500 --> 01:26:24.167
Before you got the inhibitor on her...

1179
01:26:25.333 --> 01:26:27.250
she managed to get in my mind for a moment.

1180
01:26:28.833 --> 01:26:32.333
Sara was the name of someone
I worked closely with that recently passed.

1181
01:26:32.917 --> 01:26:34.000
I'm sorry to hear that

1182
01:26:35.500 --> 01:26:39.250
Somehow the memory of Sara
must have affected her.

1183
01:26:42.333 --> 01:26:45.000
Well. I'd love to talk to her
when she wakes up. if that's all right.

1184
01:26:45.250 --> 01:26:49.083
Of course. She'll be transferred
to our facility on Roosevelt Island.

1185
01:26:49.250 --> 01:26:51.500
Now. I'm just as eager
to get her talking as you are...

1186
01:26:51.667 --> 01:26:53.583
but let's not strain her too much in one day.

1187
01:26:54.250 --> 01:26:55.250
Yeah. of course.

1188
01:26:56.083 --> 01:26:57.250
Thank you. Spider-Man.

1189
01:26:57.500 --> 01:26:58.417
My pleasure.

1190
01:27:11.583 --> 01:27:13.750
It worked. She's in custody.

1191
01:27:13.917 --> 01:27:14.917
You're safe now.

1192
01:27:18.167 --> 01:27:19.083
You left this.

1193
01:27:27.417 --> 01:27:28.667
Did you want me to find it?

1194
01:27:30.833 --> 01:27:32.667
No. No.

1195
01:27:33.917 --> 01:27:34.917
Look. I can explain. I...

1196
01:27:35.083 --> 01:27:36.333
Can you take that off. please?

1197
01:27:40.333 --> 01:27:41.250
The mask.

1198
01:27:43.417 --> 01:27:47.917
I think I deserve to have this conversation
with "Peter Parker."

1199
01:28:13.917 --> 01:28:15.750
You came to the party
at our apartment the other night.

1200
01:28:22.333 --> 01:28:23.500
And the donut shop.

1201
01:28:25.750 --> 01:28:27.083
The year I went off to school.

1202
01:28:30.000 --> 01:28:31.083
Why didn't you tell me then?

1203
01:28:31.833 --> 01:28:33.417
I was trying to protect you.

1204
01:28:34.000 --> 01:28:36.667
Yeah. well. I've almost been killed. like.
five times in the past 24 hours...

1205
01:28:36.917 --> 01:28:38.417
so it's not really working that well.

1206
01:28:39.333 --> 01:28:40.583
I know. I'm sorry. I...

1207
01:28:42.083 --> 01:28:43.333
Were you ever gonna tell me?

1208
01:28:50.333 --> 01:28:51.250
Right.

1209
01:28:52.833 --> 01:28:55.167
So you just were gonna
make that decision for me.

1210
01:28:55.917 --> 01:28:56.917
I know. I'm sorry.

1211
01:28:57.167 --> 01:28:58.917
I don't really need you to keep saying
that you're sorry.

1212
01:28:59.083 --> 01:29:00.750
-I don't know what you want me to tell you.
-I want you to tell me...

1213
01:29:00.917 --> 01:29:02.250
why you would do this to me.

1214
01:29:08.417 --> 01:29:09.583
I lost someone.

1215
01:29:13.583 --> 01:29:15.667
And they'd still be here if it wasn't for me.

1216
01:29:20.500 --> 01:29:22.083
I didn't read you that letter because...

1217
01:29:23.417 --> 01:29:25.667
I didn't want anything like that
to happen to you.

1218
01:29:25.833 --> 01:29:26.917
But that's not really
your decision to make

1219
01:29:27.167 --> 01:29:28.417
I know it's not. but...

1220
01:29:30.833 --> 01:29:32.083
You mean everything to me.

1221
01:29:35.417 --> 01:29:37.750
And I've been trying to live my life
without you. but I...

1222
01:29:39.667 --> 01:29:40.667
I can't.

1223
01:29:46.917 --> 01:29:47.833
I love you.

1224
01:30:00.000 --> 01:30:03.000
This spell or whatever it is that you did...

1225
01:30:06.750 --> 01:30:07.667
It worked.

1226
01:30:10.667 --> 01:30:13.917
All these memories that you're saying
that we have together. I don't...

1227
01:30:16.167 --> 01:30:17.250
I don't have them. 1

1228
01:30:21.083 --> 01:30:23.250
And I do see why. you know.
she would love you...

1229
01:30:23.417 --> 01:30:26.000
the girl you wrote that letter to. but...

1230
01:30:30.833 --> 01:30:31.833
I understand...

1231
01:30:32.917 --> 01:30:35.833
that you did what you had to do
to protect her.

1232
01:30:38.167 --> 01:30:40.833
And for that I'm so grateful.

1233
01:30:44.333 --> 01:30:45.333
But I...

1234
01:30:49.417 --> 01:30:50.667
I don't love you.

1235
01:30:55.083 --> 01:30:56.083
Because I don't...

1236
01:30:56.667 --> 01:30:58.250
I don't even know you.

1237
01:31:07.000 --> 01:31:09.333
I should probably go now.

1238
01:31:15.750 --> 01:31:17.250
I really am sorry. Peter.

1239
01:31:35.583 --> 01:31:36.750
I don't have a phone.

1240
01:31:40.000 --> 01:31:41.333
Do you mind taking me home?

1241
01:31:44.167 --> 01:31:45.167
Yeah. of course.

1242
01:31:45.333 --> 01:31:46.333
Thank you.

1243
01:32:29.250 --> 01:32:30.750
-Thank you.
-Yeah. sure.

1244
01:32:32.000 --> 01:32:33.000
I'm going to...

1245
01:32:33.167 --> 01:32:34.667
Yeah. yeah. Yeah. of course.

1246
01:32:44.167 --> 01:32:45.250
Do you wanna come up?

1247
01:32:47.417 --> 01:32:49.667
Just to say hi to Ned. Maybe.

1248
01:32:53.083 --> 01:32:54.083
I would love that.

1249
01:32:55.167 --> 01:32:55.917
Okay.

1250
01:32:56.167 --> 01:32:59.250
The Hulk. a.k.a. Dr. Bruce Banner.
is in custody...

1251
01:32:59.500 --> 01:33:01.667
currently being transferred
to a psychiatric ward.

1252
01:33:02.000 --> 01:33:02.833
So sad

1253
01:33:03.083 --> 01:33:05.167
After years as a peaceful academic...

1254
01:33:05.417 --> 01:33:08.167
the question the world asked today is...

1255
01:33:08.333 --> 01:33:09.750
"What finally snapped?"

1256
01:33:16.167 --> 01:33:17.667
Hey. I'm nearby.

1257
01:33:18.000 --> 01:33:19.583
-Hey. I'm nearby.
-MJ?

1258
01:33:19.750 --> 01:33:21.417
-Yeah.
-Hey. I'm nearby.

1259
01:33:22.250 --> 01:33:23.250
Hey. I'm nearby.

1260
01:33:23.583 --> 01:33:24.583
You're not gonna believe this...

1261
01:33:24.750 --> 01:33:26.583
-Hey. I'm nearby.
-...but the Spidey Tracker app...

1262
01:33:26.750 --> 01:33:27.750
-...says that Spider-Man...
-Hey. I'm nearby.

1263
01:33:28.000 --> 01:33:30.000
-...is in the direct vicinity.
-Hey. I'm nearby.

1264
01:33:30.167 --> 01:33:31.833
-Oh. yeah? No way. That's crazy.
-Hey. I'm nearby.

1265
01:33:32.583 --> 01:33:33.917
Hey. I'm nearby.

1266
01:33:35.167 --> 01:33:37.083
Ned. Spider-Man. Spider-Man. Ned.

1267
01:33:37.583 --> 01:33:38.667
It's nice to meet you. Ned.

1268
01:33:38.917 --> 01:33:39.167
Hello.

1269
01:33:40.583 --> 01:33:42.750
-I'm not. like. a weirdo or anything. I'm...
-He's a little weird.

1270
01:33:43.000 --> 01:33:45.417
Why are you here?

1271
01:33:46.500 --> 01:33:46.833
-1...
-I was...

1272
01:33:47.750 --> 01:33:49.917
-I was on a subway platform.
-She was in the... Platform. Right.

1273
01:33:50.083 --> 01:33:51.917
-And she was on her phone.
-Yeah. and... Yeah. I got a little distracted.

1274
01:33:52.167 --> 01:33:53.167
-And the train was coming and he...
-I mean...

1275
01:33:53.417 --> 01:33:54.500
And I just swooped her right up.

1276
01:33:54.667 --> 01:33:56.167
-Yep. Saved me.
-Yeah.

1277
01:33:58.667 --> 01:33:59.417
Oh. my God.

1278
01:34:00.583 --> 01:34:02.000
Why has that never happened to me?

1279
01:34:02.583 --> 01:34:05.833
So what if you're mid-swing
and you decide you need to pee?

1280
01:34:06.083 --> 01:34:07.500
Do you just land on top of a building?

1281
01:34:07.750 --> 01:34:08.667
What?

1282
01:34:08.917 --> 01:34:11.000
Do you drop down to ground level
and run into a coffee shop and you're like...

1283
01:34:11.250 --> 01:34:12.333
"Hey. it's Spider-Man. I need to pee"?

1284
01:34:12.583 --> 01:34:14.167
Or do you find a rooftop somewhere?

1285
01:34:14.417 --> 01:34:16.083
No. I don't find a rooftop somewhere. Ned.

1286
01:34:16.250 --> 01:34:18.167
Is this really
what you wanna be asking him right now?

1287
01:34:18.417 --> 01:34:19.750
Yeah. dude. come on.
you can ask me anything.

1288
01:34:20.000 --> 01:34:21.333
You wanna know how my web shooters work?

1289
01:34:21.583 --> 01:34:23.083
I mean. I already know
how the web shooters work.

1290
01:34:23.667 --> 01:34:24.417
Is that right?

1291
01:34:24.667 --> 01:34:27.500
Well. there's obviously
some sort of a shear-thinning fluid...

1292
01:34:27.667 --> 01:34:31.083
that is cycling within a chamber. right?
So it can keep its liquid form.

1293
01:34:31.333 --> 01:34:33.583
And then. when you activate it
by pressing on the triggers...

1294
01:34:33.833 --> 01:34:35.250
it runs through a Teflon turbine...

1295
01:34:35.500 --> 01:34:39.167
and then it hardens
when it interacts with the air. Right?

1296
01:34:42.167 --> 01:34:44.083
I mean. not exactly. but...

1297
01:34:44.333 --> 01:34:46.500
Okay. okay. well. then tell me
what's in the web fluid.

1298
01:34:46.667 --> 01:34:49.750
I would guess something
like a long chain polymer

1299
01:34:49.917 --> 01:34:50.917
Nylon?

1300
01:34:51.083 --> 01:34:52.083
That's pretty close.

1301
01:34:52.250 --> 01:34:55.167
Okay. okay. What about Nomex or Kevlar?

1302
01:34:57.750 --> 01:34:59.583
"All right. then. Keep your secrets."

1303
01:34:59.750 --> 01:35:02.667
"If you're referring
to the incident with the dragon...

1304
01:35:02.833 --> 01:35:04.083
"I was barely involved."

1305
01:35:04.333 --> 01:35:07.833
"All I did was simply give your uncle
a little nudge out the door."

1306
01:35:10.417 --> 01:35:11.500
Solid reference.

1307
01:35:13.250 --> 01:35:14.333
Banh mi time.

1308
01:35:14.500 --> 01:35:15.750
You ordered banh mis?

1309
01:35:16.000 --> 01:35:17.083
I ordered five banh mis.

1310
01:35:17.250 --> 01:35:19.167
We have Spider-Man in the apartment.
He's gonna get fed.

1311
01:35:22.833 --> 01:35:25.750
Sorry about him. He's just. like.
very excited that you're here.

1312
01:35:25.917 --> 01:35:28.250
You kidding? This is. like.
the most fun I've had in years.

1313
01:35:28.917 --> 01:35:30.417
I really missed you guys.

1314
01:35:32.333 --> 01:35:34.250
You guys really do look like best friends.

1315
01:35:34.417 --> 01:35:35.417
What do you mean?

1316
01:35:45.000 --> 01:35:45.917
You should tell him.

1317
01:35:46.750 --> 01:35:47.667
He can handle it.

1318
01:35:49.583 --> 01:35:50.500
Yeah. I know.

1319
01:35:57.750 --> 01:36:01.000
When she was inhabiting you on the rooftop...

1320
01:36:02.500 --> 01:36:03.667
she kissed me...

1321
01:36:04.750 --> 01:36:06.250
and I kissed her back...

1322
01:36:06.417 --> 01:36:08.833
because I thought it was you.
but I didn't know.

1323
01:36:09.667 --> 01:36:11.417
And I'm really sorry.

1324
01:36:12.833 --> 01:36:14.083
I just thought you should know.

1325
01:36:16.583 --> 01:36:17.500
Thanks for telling me.

1326
01:36:21.167 --> 01:36:23.833
I mean. it's not like
I remember anything anyway. so...

1327
01:36:25.333 --> 01:36:26.250
Really?

1328
01:36:26.500 --> 01:36:29.167
Yeah. It was weird. it was like.
one second I was sitting at my desk.

1329
01:36:29.417 --> 01:36:31.167
and the next second
I was lying on the street.

1330
01:36:32.083 --> 01:36:33.583
I don't know. like a light switch went off.

1331
01:36:36.167 --> 01:36:37.083
What?

1332
01:36:37.333 --> 01:36:38.667
So you don't remember anything?

1333
01:36:40.750 --> 01:36:41.750
No. Why?

1334
01:36:41.917 --> 01:36:44.667
Metzger said he remembered
thinking about someone named Sara...

1335
01:36:44.833 --> 01:36:48.083
but what you're saying
is that you don't remember anything at all?

1336
01:36:50.250 --> 01:36:52.500
I mean. yeah. it was instantaneous.

1337
01:36:52.667 --> 01:36:53.833
That's what made it so scary.

1338
01:36:55.917 --> 01:36:57.083
He lied to me.

1339
01:37:00.167 --> 01:37:01.750
I heard you caught leshy.

1340
01:37:01.917 --> 01:37:02.750
Yeah. Her name's Jean Grey.

1341
01:37:03.167 --> 01:37:05.417
I need some help
determining the size of some potatoes.

1342
01:37:05.667 --> 01:37:07.333
-Potatoes?
-I think that's Black Widow

1343
01:37:07.500 --> 01:37:09.333
I think Metzger lied to me about a name.

1344
01:37:09.583 --> 01:37:13.083
Can you see if there's a connection
between Jean and someone named Sara?

1345
01:37:14.250 --> 01:37:15.917
These potatoes sound meager.

1346
01:37:17.583 --> 01:37:19.250
Wow. That really is your office.

1347
01:37:20.000 --> 01:37:21.000
Well. well. well.

1348
01:37:21.167 --> 01:37:23.417
Internet. government records...

1349
01:37:23.667 --> 01:37:28.250
and a lot of data related to Jean Grey
has been scrubbed by Damage Control.

1350
01:37:28.500 --> 01:37:29.417
Data about what?

1351
01:37:30.417 --> 01:37:31.417
Her sister.

1352
01:37:32.083 --> 01:37:33.500
Wait. Jean has a sister?

1353
01:37:36.167 --> 01:37:37.083
Sara Grey.

1354
01:37:37.333 --> 01:37:38.750
Also a telepath.

1355
01:37:39.000 --> 01:37:42.667
Damage Control took her into custody
for study and observation.

1356
01:37:42.917 --> 01:37:45.000
Wow. I mean. you can probably guess
what they mean by that.

1357
01:37:45.167 --> 01:37:47.333
Experimentation
and other human rights violations.

1358
01:37:47.583 --> 01:37:49.250
Yes. exactly. Wait. who are you?

1359
01:37:50.250 --> 01:37:51.000
-Hi. Ned Leeds. Big fan.
-I'm...

1360
01:37:51.333 --> 01:37:52.750
Hi.

1361
01:37:52.750 --> 01:37:53.667
I'm sorry.

1362
01:37:54.167 --> 01:37:57.167
I'm just so happy
that the sad man has friends.

1363
01:37:59.333 --> 01:38:01.500
Thanks. I owe you one.

1364
01:38:02.667 --> 01:38:03.833
Good luck. Spider-Man.

1365
01:38:04.083 --> 01:38:04.500
Bye.

1366
01:38:05.167 --> 01:38:06.417
She was just looking for her sister...

1367
01:38:06.750 --> 01:38:08.750
and I handed her to the people that took her.

1368
01:38:08.917 --> 01:38:10.417
-I gotta go.
-Hey. Peter...

1369
01:38:10.667 --> 01:38:11.583
Yeah?

1370
01:38:12.667 --> 01:38:13.750
Just be careful. all right?

1371
01:38:21.417 --> 01:38:23.083
Spider-Man's name is Peter?

1372
01:38:36.750 --> 01:38:39.083
Jean. who do you want to be?

1373
01:38:42.250 --> 01:38:42.917
Her. Pink jacket.

1374
01:38:44.583 --> 01:38:45.583
She's too far.

1375
01:38:46.667 --> 01:38:47.667
You're gonna have to hop.

1376
01:38:47.917 --> 01:38:49.000
Hop?

1377
01:38:49.167 --> 01:38:51.167
First. pick someone close.

1378
01:38:52.167 --> 01:38:52.833
And then...

1379
01:39:07.083 --> 01:39:08.083
Each hop has a limit.

1380
01:39:08.750 --> 01:39:11.917
But you can string them together
and go as far as you want.

1381
01:39:15.167 --> 01:39:16.417
You're right back where you started.

1382
01:39:17.667 --> 01:39:19.917
Could you do that
to everyone in this park at once?

1383
01:39:20.833 --> 01:39:22.167
Well. yeah. maybe one day.

1384
01:39:22.917 --> 01:39:24.083
If you get really good.

1385
01:39:37.750 --> 01:39:38.667
How could she just...

1386
01:39:42.667 --> 01:39:43.917
She wasn't really a mom

1387
01:39:47.333 --> 01:39:49.333
She was. before we changed.

1388
01:39:51.417 --> 01:39:52.333
then you're not a mom.

1389
01:39:53.333 --> 01:39:55.417
What would you do
if you had daughters like us?

1390
01:39:55.917 --> 01:39:56.917
I'd love them.

1391
01:40:00.583 --> 01:40:02.250
-Especially the redhead one.
-Shut up.

1392
01:40:05.083 --> 01:40:06.417
We have each other.

1393
01:40:10.250 --> 01:40:10.917
And we have ice cream.

1394
01:40:13.750 --> 01:40:15.083
-One mint chip. one chocolate?
-Yeah.

1395
01:40:21.667 --> 01:40:22.250
Okay.

1396
01:40:24.083 --> 01:40:25.583
Now I know how you're playing.

1397
01:40:43.167 --> 01:40:45.583
-Get down! 
-Get down!

1398
01:40:45.833 --> 01:40:47.667
Get down on the ground now!
-Get down! Get down!

1399
01:40:49.833 --> 01:40:51.083
-Down!
-Sara!

1400
01:40:56.667 --> 01:40:57.750
I'm sorry. Jean.

1401
01:40:58.917 --> 01:41:00.333
I have to keep you safe.

1402
01:41:42.833 --> 01:41:45.917
Subject is awake. Heart rate is 94 bpm.

1403
01:41:48.750 --> 01:41:52.333
Jean. that's not gonna work anymore.
thanks to Spider-Man.

1404
01:41:55.833 --> 01:41:56.750
Jean?

1405
01:42:06.333 --> 01:42:07.417
I need you to breathe.

1406
01:42:07.667 --> 01:42:09.250
I need you to look at me and breathe.

1407
01:42:09.833 --> 01:42:10.917
Okay?

1408
01:42:11.167 --> 01:42:12.583
You're safe. Breathe.

1409
01:42:15.250 --> 01:42:16.417
Where is she?

1410
01:42:17.833 --> 01:42:19.583
Like your sister.
you've been blessed with a power...

1411
01:42:19.833 --> 01:42:22.583
that has the potential
to do tremendous good in the world...

1412
01:42:23.333 --> 01:42:24.667
or tremendous damage.

1413
01:42:25.667 --> 01:42:29.667
A power like yours in the hands of a child
is an impossible burden.

1414
01:42:30.333 --> 01:42:31.417
But imagine...

1415
01:42:32.583 --> 01:42:34.917
if that power was placed
in the hands of people...

1416
01:42:35.083 --> 01:42:36.417
who actually know what to do with it.

1417
01:42:45.417 --> 01:42:47.167
Where is my sister?

1418
01:42:50.083 --> 01:42:52.000
You're gonna change the world. Jean.

1419
01:42:52.417 --> 01:42:53.417
Hey!

1420
01:42:54.167 --> 01:42:55.167
Hey!

1421
01:43:18.833 --> 01:43:20.083
I know where you are. what you're doing.

1422
01:43:20.250 --> 01:43:21.333
Oh. yeah? And how's that?

1423
01:43:22.000 --> 01:43:23.250
I got eyes everywhere. kid.

1424
01:43:24.917 --> 01:43:27.250
Look. Frank.
Damage Control kidnapped Jean's sister.

1425
01:43:27.500 --> 01:43:29.917
Jean was just trying to find her.
We were wrong about everything.

1426
01:43:30.167 --> 01:43:31.500
Sentimental horseshit.

1427
01:43:32.417 --> 01:43:34.417
You've seen what she can do
and what she's capable of.

1428
01:43:34.583 --> 01:43:37.083
What. you're gonna let her loose?
Is that what you're gonna do?

1429
01:43:38.333 --> 01:43:41.833
I'll tell you right now. you do that.
I handle it my way.

1430
01:43:42.333 --> 01:43:43.833
Frank. please. can you just...

1431
01:43:44.167 --> 01:43:45.250
Frank!

1432
01:43:57.833 --> 01:43:58.833
Distance check?

1433
01:43:59.000 --> 01:44:00.167
Forty-foot clearance.

1434
01:44:00.333 --> 01:44:01.667
Locking down the room.

1435
01:44:01.833 --> 01:44:02.667
Locking down.

1436
01:44:08.167 --> 01:44:09.083
Disengage inhibitor.

1437
01:44:13.667 --> 01:44:15.750
Jean. your powers are now fully operational.

1438
01:44:25.333 --> 01:44:28.167
As you can tell.
we are beyond your jump radius.

1439
01:44:29.583 --> 01:44:31.250
Tell me what V-Max is.

1440
01:44:32.083 --> 01:44:33.750
You're the second person
to ask me about that.

1441
01:44:34.833 --> 01:44:36.250
I have no idea what that means.

1442
01:44:36.500 --> 01:44:38.000
She sent me a message.

1443
01:44:38.667 --> 01:44:40.417
She was trying to help me find her.

1444
01:44:41.417 --> 01:44:44.833
She communicated with you telepathically
across all that distance?

1445
01:44:45.333 --> 01:44:48.333
We did register a huge spike in that session.

1446
01:44:50.167 --> 01:44:51.167
Fascinating.

1447
01:44:51.333 --> 01:44:53.583
What does it mean?

1448
01:44:55.250 --> 01:44:56.250
I don't know.

1449
01:44:57.250 --> 01:44:58.583
Let's begin.

1450
01:45:06.750 --> 01:45:08.917
Our work with Sara centered on two areas...

1451
01:45:09.167 --> 01:45:11.333
identifying the source of her power...

1452
01:45:11.500 --> 01:45:14.417
and identifying a path towards copying it.

1453
01:45:14.583 --> 01:45:18.417
If we could find a way to record
a telepathic brain during a jump...

1454
01:45:18.667 --> 01:45:21.417
then perhaps we could replicate
those pathways...

1455
01:45:21.667 --> 01:45:23.333
in a mind of our choosing.

1456
01:45:24.833 --> 01:45:27.917
This instrument is your sister's legacy.

1457
01:45:29.083 --> 01:45:32.000
We built this together
over many months of trial and error.

1458
01:45:33.167 --> 01:45:35.333
I hope you and I can honor her sacrifice.

1459
01:45:38.500 --> 01:45:39.750
What are you talking about?

1460
01:45:41.333 --> 01:45:42.583
Trigger the first jump.

1461
01:45:47.333 --> 01:45:49.750
Tell me what V-Max is.

1462
01:45:49.917 --> 01:45:51.500
I know that's where you're hiding her.

1463
01:46:06.833 --> 01:46:07.750
She's jumping.

1464
01:46:10.083 --> 01:46:10.750
Copy.

1465
01:46:11.583 --> 01:46:14.500
We're in full lockdown.
Process has commenced.

1466
01:46:14.667 --> 01:46:15.500
What process?

1467
01:46:17.167 --> 01:46:19.500
Hey. whoa.
that's a pretty serious look there. dude.

1468
01:46:20.333 --> 01:46:21.750
Hey. hey. whoa! What the hell. man?

1469
01:46:22.000 --> 01:46:24.000
Come on. I'm a friend of Damage Control.
What are you doin'?

1470
01:46:28.583 --> 01:46:30.083
It's gonna be like that. You wanna go.

1471
01:46:30.333 --> 01:46:31.250
All right.

1472
01:46:31.750 --> 01:46:33.250
All right. well. just give me a sec.

1473
01:46:33.833 --> 01:46:34.750
Give me a sec.

1474
01:46:35.667 --> 01:46:37.167
I'm not in high school anymore.

1475
01:46:39.417 --> 01:46:40.917
Do you stretch? You a big stretcher?

1476
01:46:41.083 --> 01:46:42.333
I mean. you should do it
in your line of work

1477
01:46:43.000 --> 01:46:46.167
What about you? You guys stretch?
It's so good for you.

1478
01:46:47.833 --> 01:46:48.750
You ready?

1479
01:46:58.417 --> 01:46:59.333
Watch your head!

1480
01:47:19.250 --> 01:47:21.000
Where is Jean Grey?

1481
01:47:22.083 --> 01:47:23.667
That's jump 26.

1482
01:47:23.917 --> 01:47:25.000
Recordings look good.

1483
01:47:25.250 --> 01:47:26.333
Excuse me. sir.

1484
01:47:27.250 --> 01:47:28.333
We have an intruder.

1485
01:47:33.417 --> 01:47:34.667
You were right.

1486
01:47:34.833 --> 01:47:36.750
She's much stronger than her sister.

1487
01:47:37.750 --> 01:47:39.000
Increase the frequency.

1488
01:47:40.500 --> 01:47:41.833
You're doing very well. Jean.

1489
01:48:29.750 --> 01:48:31.000
Jean?

1490
01:48:35.500 --> 01:48:36.583
Jean. can you hear me?

1491
01:48:43.083 --> 01:48:44.083
Jean?

1492
01:48:48.667 --> 01:48:49.917
You're a murderer.

1493
01:48:52.250 --> 01:48:55.167
Her frequencies are evolving.

1494
01:48:55.417 --> 01:48:56.583
This doesn't make sense.

1495
01:48:57.583 --> 01:49:01.667
The last thing my sister saw was this room.

1496
01:49:01.833 --> 01:49:04.667
Her brainwaves are somehow
affecting the objects around her.

1497
01:49:05.750 --> 01:49:06.750
I'm trying. sir.

1498
01:49:06.917 --> 01:49:07.917
What do you mean you're trying?

1499
01:49:08.417 --> 01:49:13.417
The last thing my sister saw
was this goddamn room!

1500
01:49:13.583 --> 01:49:15.500
-Shut it down!
-I can't. sir.

1501
01:49:16.750 --> 01:49:17.583
Move.

1502
01:49:20.000 --> 01:49:21.917
I can't let you do that. Bill.

1503
01:49:25.667 --> 01:49:29.667
The only hands that will wield this power...

1504
01:49:30.750 --> 01:49:32.250
are mine.

1505
01:51:44.833 --> 01:51:46.417
-What...
-What do you want?

1506
01:51:49.833 --> 01:51:52.750
Jean. I'm here to help you.

1507
01:51:54.083 --> 01:51:55.500
You put me here

1508
01:51:56.417 --> 01:52:00.417
I know. and I'm sorry about Sara.
and I'm sorry that I got it so wrong.

1509
01:52:02.750 --> 01:52:03.667
If you came here...

1510
01:52:03.917 --> 01:52:07.083
to save a helpless girl from Damage Control.
you're too late.

1511
01:52:08.167 --> 01:52:09.917
They're the ones who need saving.

1512
01:52:10.083 --> 01:52:11.167
And now...

1513
01:52:15.417 --> 01:52:16.167
Here we go.

1514
01:52:30.917 --> 01:52:32.333
God. that's cool.

1515
01:52:53.417 --> 01:52:55.417
Jean! Jean. please!

1516
01:53:09.750 --> 01:53:11.333
Come on! Come on! Come on!

1517
01:53:32.083 --> 01:53:33.167
What?

1518
01:53:35.250 --> 01:53:36.083
Isn't it funny...

1519
01:53:36.250 --> 01:53:39.667
how your friends from Damage Control
developed a special weapon.

1520
01:53:39.750 --> 01:53:40.917
just for you?

1521
01:53:42.250 --> 01:53:44.833
They've got a whole task force ready.

1522
01:53:45.000 --> 01:53:46.833
Just in case you ever get out of line.

1523
01:53:51.333 --> 01:53:52.750
People are monsters.

1524
01:53:57.750 --> 01:54:00.917
You shouldn't trust them
any more than they trust you.

1525
01:54:14.500 --> 01:54:15.583
I'm a little busy. Frank.

1526
01:54:15.750 --> 01:54:17.000
We got a problem. kid.

1527
01:54:17.250 --> 01:54:19.833
She got ahold of everyone
within a kilometer of the island.

1528
01:54:20.500 --> 01:54:21.500
Wait. what?

1529
01:54:27.500 --> 01:54:29.667
Hey. look. if you're gonna do something.
you better do it now.

1530
01:54:29.833 --> 01:54:30.917
I'm trying!

1531
01:54:56.500 --> 01:54:57.833
Kid?

1532
01:54:58.000 --> 01:54:59.750
Shit! Goddamn it.

1533
01:55:33.667 --> 01:55:34.667
My sister died...

1534
01:55:34.917 --> 01:55:36.167
in this room...

1535
01:55:37.500 --> 01:55:39.167
surrounded by these men.

1536
01:55:40.500 --> 01:55:41.583
And her only crime...

1537
01:55:41.750 --> 01:55:43.333
was that she was special.

1538
01:55:45.167 --> 01:55:46.333
Just like you.

1539
01:55:51.667 --> 01:55:54.667
People like us
don't get to live a normal life.

1540
01:55:57.667 --> 01:56:00.833
We don't get to have friends or a family.

1541
01:56:02.833 --> 01:56:04.167
Those people are gone.

1542
01:56:07.000 --> 01:56:08.667
That life is over.

1543
01:56:34.833 --> 01:56:37.250
So why don't you just
be honest with yourself?

1544
01:56:40.250 --> 01:56:41.583
Are you Peter Parker?

1545
01:56:43.750 --> 01:56:45.083
Or are you Spider-Man?

1546
01:57:18.083 --> 01:57:19.083
I'm both.

1547
01:59:03.833 --> 01:59:05.833
Jean. please. -

1548
01:59:07.083 --> 01:59:08.500
This won't make it right.

1549
01:59:10.667 --> 01:59:12.500
Come on. You're not a killer. Jean.

1550
01:59:12.667 --> 01:59:13.917
You have no idea what I am.

1551
01:59:15.667 --> 01:59:17.333
I know that you loved your sister.

1552
01:59:20.667 --> 01:59:23.500
And I know that losing her
felt like you'd lost everything.

1553
01:59:23.667 --> 01:59:26.667
If you come any closer. he dies! They all do!

1554
01:59:44.917 --> 01:59:46.333
You know this won't bring her back.
right. Jean?

1555
01:59:46.500 --> 01:59:47.500
You...

1556
02:00:04.167 --> 02:00:06.250
Don't be so sure I can't get into your mind.

1557
02:00:08.417 --> 02:00:10.667
I'm a lot more powerful since I last tried.

1558
02:00:20.833 --> 02:00:22.083
Go ahead.

1559
02:00:33.500 --> 02:00:34.750
Hey.

1560
02:00:36.833 --> 02:00:40.500
You think you don't have to listen to me
now that you've got powers?

1561
02:00:45.167 --> 02:00:50.667
You know. this whole thing
can get really scary.

1562
02:00:50.833 --> 02:00:51.833
You know that?

1563
02:01:10.417 --> 02:01:12.000
It's already pretty scary.

1564
02:01:14.917 --> 02:01:17.750
And things can change. like. very quickly..

1565
02:01:17.917 --> 02:01:20.833
in ways that we can't even imagine right now.

1566
02:01:21.000 --> 02:01:22.000
I know.

1567
02:01:25.917 --> 02:01:27.667
I don't think you do know.

1568
02:01:29.500 --> 02:01:31.083
What do you mean?

1569
02:01:34.167 --> 02:01:35.917
You're a really special person.

1570
02:01:37.500 --> 02:01:40.417
And I would hope that that will always
make you feel really great about yourself...

1571
02:01:41.500 --> 02:01:44.250
but I know sometimes it doesn't.

1572
02:01:44.417 --> 02:01:46.833
Sometimes you'll be really lonely.

1573
02:01:50.500 --> 02:01:51.667
And sometimes...

1574
02:01:53.083 --> 02:01:54.500
because you're special...

1575
02:01:56.917 --> 02:02:00.667
people can do dark. monstrous things to you.

1576
02:02:05.500 --> 02:02:06.917
this is what I want you to know.

1577
02:02:08.917 --> 02:02:10.667
You're beautiful...

1578
02:02:10.833 --> 02:02:12.167
and the people who love you...

1579
02:02:12.333 --> 02:02:16.167
we love you not because you're special.
love you because you're you.

1580
02:02:18.333 --> 02:02:19.750
Iwant you to remember that.

1581
02:02:22.000 --> 02:02:24.000
Evenen it feels like you're totally alone.

1582
02:02:27.000 --> 02:02:28.917
That's your deepest responsibility.

1583
02:02:32.250 --> 02:02:35.500
Never forget that.
no matter how powerful you become.

1584
02:02:51.667 --> 02:02:52.750
Hey.

1585
02:03:08.500 --> 02:03:10.083
I'm sorry about your sister.

1586
02:03:15.333 --> 02:03:17.167
I'm sorry about your aunt.

1587
02:03:20.583 --> 02:03:21.833
Yeah. you would've loved her.

1588
02:03:25.667 --> 02:03:27.583
Just because we've lost someone...

1589
02:03:30.750 --> 02:03:32.750
It doesn't mean we have to do this alone.

1590
02:03:34.833 --> 02:03:37.583
I mean. we can't.

1591
02:03:37.750 --> 02:03:39.417
Trust me. I've been trying.

1592
02:03:42.667 --> 02:03:43.833
It doesn't work.

1593
02:03:48.667 --> 02:03:49.917
Even if that's true...

1594
02:03:54.250 --> 02:03:55.417
I have no one.

1595
02:04:00.167 --> 02:04:01.250
You have me.

1596
02:04:45.833 --> 02:04:46.833
Are you hurt?

1597
02:04:47.250 --> 02:04:48.333
No. I'm fine.

1598
02:04:54.250 --> 02:04:55.250
I'm okay.

1599
02:04:56.167 --> 02:04:57.583
-Peter.
-I'm okay. I'm okay. I'm okay.

1600
02:04:57.750 --> 02:04:58.833
Peter. No.

1601
02:05:02.917 --> 02:05:04.750
Peter. Peter. No. no.

1602
02:05:04.917 --> 02:05:06.750
No. no. no. Peter. Peter.

1603
02:05:08.000 --> 02:05:10.333
Jean. you gotta get outta here.
They'll be looking for you.

1604
02:05:10.500 --> 02:05:12.250
No. no. no. Please. just stay with me.

1605
02:05:12.417 --> 02:05:13.417
Come on. hold on. Come on. please!

1606
02:05:13.667 --> 02:05:14.833
Jean. you're...

1607
02:05:15.667 --> 02:05:17.167
You're gonna be okay.

1608
02:05:18.500 --> 02:05:19.500
Just go.

1609
02:05:21.667 --> 02:05:22.667
Look at me.

1610
02:05:40.417 --> 02:05:45.333
Shock today as Spider-Man anuved
alellevue Hospital with a bullet wound

1611
02:05:45.833 --> 02:05:47.500
seemingly at death's door.

1612
02:05:51.333 --> 02:05:52.250
The reclusive crime fighter
is in critical condition...

1613
02:05:52.417 --> 02:05:55.167
as the city's top medical experts
work to save him.

1614
02:05:58.833 --> 02:06:01.583
Tonight. all eyes are on Spider-Man.

1615
02:06:03.667 --> 02:06:06.000
The hero who saved New York so many times...

1616
02:06:06.500 --> 02:06:08.833
is now in the hands
of its best and brightest.

1617
02:06:11.500 --> 02:06:14.417
Arrd the people of New York hold their breath.

1618
02:07:28.833 --> 02:07:31.000
-No. no. no. Hey.
-Where's my mask?

1619
02:07:31.167 --> 02:07:32.500
Don't worry about that. Iot you covered.

1620
02:07:32.750 --> 02:07:33.667
Hey. you're good.

1621
02:07:34.083 --> 02:07:35.417
Where's Jean? Is she okay?

1622
02:07:35.583 --> 02:07:37.417
Yeah. she's okay. She's okay.

1623
02:07:37.583 --> 02:07:38.750
-Where is she?
-Kid.

1624
02:07:40.083 --> 02:07:41.667
I think maybe she just left.

1625
02:07:42.917 --> 02:07:47.583
She was using her magic voodoo shit
to keep you alive.

1626
02:07:58.000 --> 02:07:59.000
I'm sorry.

1627
02:08:03.833 --> 02:08:06.917
-Frank. Frank. it's okay.
-Just. I'm really sorry for what I did.

1628
02:08:07.167 --> 02:08:08.667
-No. Frank. it's okay.
-And it's. no. it's a lot of things...

1629
02:08:09.000 --> 02:08:10.833
but it sure as shit ain't okay. all right?

1630
02:08:14.500 --> 02:08:15.500
I've seen...

1631
02:08:17.333 --> 02:08:20.917
I've seen real bravery. kid. in my day.

1632
02:08:22.667 --> 02:08:23.667
But that...

1633
02:08:25.083 --> 02:08:26.500
What was something else

1634
02:08:30.000 --> 02:08:31.167
You crying. Frank?

1635
02:08:31.417 --> 02:08:32.917
No. I ain't...

1636
02:08:39.667 --> 02:08:41.583
You know. you look the exact way
I thought you would.

1637
02:08:44.167 --> 02:08:45.250
A nice kid.

1638
02:08:47.833 --> 02:08:49.083
Never had a friend like that.

1639
02:08:59.500 --> 02:09:00.917
I can't believe I just saw you cry.

1640
02:09:01.083 --> 02:09:03.083
I didn't cry. What are you talking about?

1641
02:09:04.083 --> 02:09:04.333
Bullshit.

1642
02:09:06.667 --> 02:09:08.083
Yeah. this.

1643
02:09:08.583 --> 02:09:09.833
They've been doing it all night.

1644
02:09:10.000 --> 02:09:12.500
They've been here since you walked in.
Just take a look.

1645
02:09:23.333 --> 02:09:26.167
Yo. kid. when you came in.
they had to cut through the suit...

1646
02:09:26.333 --> 02:09:28.417
but when you're ready to split...

1647
02:09:29.667 --> 02:09:30.750
I got a plan.

1648
02:09:32.667 --> 02:09:37.167
Dr. Moseley. 2495.

1649
02:09:52.667 --> 02:09:54.583
Hey. it's Spider-Man!

1650
02:09:57.167 --> 02:09:58.583
Spider-Man!

1651
02:10:06.083 --> 02:10:07.500
Yeah. Spider-Man!

1652
02:10:08.917 --> 02:10:10.667
You're the best. Spider-Man!

1653
02:10:11.750 --> 02:10:13.000
Spider-Man!

1654
02:10:16.917 --> 02:10:18.083
We love you!

1655
02:10:52.250 --> 02:10:56.333
Spider-Man! Spider-Man! Spider-Man!

1656
02:11:11.667 --> 02:11:15.583
Spider-Man! Spider-Man! Spider-Man!

1657
02:12:25.583 --> 02:12:29.583
I've...

1658
02:12:29.583 --> 02:12:31.500
Been thinking a lot about what you said.

1659
02:12:34.083 --> 02:12:36.750
And you'd be happy to know
that I've decided I'm not...

1660
02:12:38.500 --> 02:12:40.417
I'm not gonna do this alone anymore.

1661
02:12:50.000 --> 02:12:51.167
I miss you. May.

1662
02:13:00.583 --> 02:13:01.500
I mean. I've still got a little pain
in my back..

1663
02:13:01.750 --> 02:13:04.750
but I could probably get back out there
if you need me for anything.

1664
02:13:04.917 --> 02:13:07.083
What I need you to do is rest.

1665
02:13:07.333 --> 02:13:09.250
I know. I know. but come on.
you gotta give me something.

1666
02:13:09.417 --> 02:13:11.250
I mean. how's the investigation going?

1667
02:13:11.417 --> 02:13:14.333
Well. Metzger's still missing. but...

1668
02:13:14.833 --> 02:13:16.750
your friend. Black Widow...

1669
02:13:17.000 --> 02:13:19.500
she's been helping us dig through
all the records...

1670
02:13:19.750 --> 02:13:21.750
Damage Control tried to have scrubbed.

1671
02:13:22.333 --> 02:13:24.583
Had me drop by her office the other day.

1672
02:13:24.833 --> 02:13:25.833
And how was that?

1673
02:13:26.417 --> 02:13:28.833
Well. my skin feels amazing.

1674
02:13:30.417 --> 02:13:33.583
Attention. all units.
We have a confirmed bank robbery in progress.

1675
02:13:33.750 --> 02:13:34.750
Hey. are you getting this?

1676
02:13:36.417 --> 02:13:37.417
Yeah. I'm on it.

1677
02:13:37.583 --> 02:13:39.917
Hey. it's not that far from me.
I could probably meet you down there.

1678
02:13:40.167 --> 02:13:42.333
No. We can handle a robbery.

1679
02:13:43.333 --> 02:13:46.167
Just try to take care of yourself.

1680
02:13:47.833 --> 02:13:48.750
Okay

1681
02:13:50.167 --> 02:13:51.083
You too.

1682
02:13:52.167 --> 02:13:53.500
Say hello to EJ and Marley for me.

1683
02:13:58.333 --> 02:13:59.667
Spider-Man says hello.

1684
02:14:42.250 --> 02:14:44.000
Flower guy. right. from the party?

1685
02:14:45.750 --> 02:14:46.917
I'm Peter.

1686
02:14:48.000 --> 02:14:49.333
Okay. Hello.

1687
02:15:07.917 --> 02:15:08.917
Peter.
